  "tibetan_transliteration": "\u0f56\u0f51\u0f7a\u0f53\u0f0b\u0f46\u0f74\u0f44\u0f0b\u0f42\u0f72\u0f0b\u0f60\u0f56\u0f74\u0f58",
  "comments": "The cover page of the manuscript (ID:4604) gives the title \"dbu ma'i man ngag gi 'bum,\" but based on the contents, it is likely that it was switched with the cover page of (ID:4602), with the title \"bden gnyis kyi 'bum\". ([4W5HW75B]: 21-22)\r\n\r\nThe signature for the page with the title \"bden gnyis kyi 'bum\" ([Z5AUD7GQ]: 335) is hardly readable. [8H6M69W4], reports the signature \"phyi tsa 22\" for both No. 15400 (in 18 folios) (see (ID:4602)) and No. 15401 (in 16 fols.).\r\n\r\nBefore the false cover page, the recto of another cover page is reproduced in [Z5AUD7GQ]: 370, bearing only the signature \"phyi tsa 82\" and the letter \"ta\" in the left margin. In [Z5AUD7GQ]: 86, the signature \"phyi tsa 82\" is associated with an \"dbu ma bden gnyis kyi 'grel ba\" and a \"dbu ma'i man ngag gi 'grel ba\" (referring to (ID:4602) and (ID:4604)?), but it probably belongs to another manuscript.",
  "alternative_names": "bden chung gi 'bum (colophon)\r\nbden gnyis kyi 'bum (correct cover page)\r\ndbu ma'i man ngag gi 'bum (false cover page)\r\nbden gnyis kyi 'bu zhes pa jo bo'i dbu ma bden gnyis kyi 'grel ba (catalogue)",
